                <pb facs="0223" n="111" xml:id="pg111"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 4737/35.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Ambassador
                    Dudley.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1910-01-17"><hi rendition="#italic">January 17,
                        1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The Government and people of the United States sincerely deplore the loss Brazil
                    suffers in the death of the ambassador, who in his work among us has won the
                    esteem and good will of all.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Knox.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
